{"seq":1,"slug":"game-theoretic-reasoning","title":"博弈论的推理：把\"对手会怎么想\"变成数学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/strategic-thinking/game-theoretic-reasoning","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"博弈论的推理-把-对手会怎么想-变成数学\">博弈论的推理：把&quot;对手会怎么想&quot;变成数学</h1><p>在冯·诺依曼之前，&quot;博弈&quot;——下棋、打牌、讨价还价——被看作心理学和经验的领域，谈不上严格的数学。冯·诺依曼的关键一步，是把&quot;互相算计&quot;这件事本身形式化：当我的最优选择取决于你的选择，而你的最优选择又取决于我的选择时，这种相互依赖能不能有一个确定的、可计算的解？1928 年他在论文《社会博弈的理论》（Zur Theorie der Gesellschaftsspiele）中给出了肯定的回答，并在 1944 年与经济学家奥斯卡·摩根斯特恩合著《博弈论与经济行为》（Theory of Games and Economic Behavior），把这套推理推广成一门科学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>博弈论的推理建立在三个概念之上：<strong>策略互依</strong>（我的最优取决于你的选择，反之亦然，决策因此是相互的）、<strong>形式化要素</strong>（把任何博弈剥离成参与者、策略、支付、信息四个精确对象）、<strong>期望效用</strong>（把模糊偏好量化成可加可比、可在风险下权衡的数）。掌握这三者，&quot;互相算计&quot;就从心理学变成了可计算的数学。下文依次展开，并以一个抛硬币的小博弈点出&quot;最优行为常是可控的随机&quot;这一反直觉结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-决策-到-策略互依\">从&quot;决策&quot;到&quot;策略互依&quot;</h2><p>普通的决策论假设环境是中性的：你面对的是概率、是自然，它不会&quot;针对&quot;你。博弈论的根本不同在于：你面对的是另一个同样在最大化自身利益的理性主体，他会预判你的选择并据此行动。冯·诺依曼的推理范式可以概括为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不要问&quot;我做 A 会怎样&quot;，而要问&quot;我做 A、且对手据此做出他的最优回应，会怎样&quot;；</li>\n<li>把对手当作和你一样聪明的理性人，他也在对你做同样的推演；</li>\n<li>寻找一个谁都不愿单方面偏离的稳定结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套&quot;换位到对手、再换位回来&quot;的递归推理，正是现代战略思维的内核——从冷战核威慑到拍卖设计，都建立在它之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"博弈的形式化要素\">博弈的形式化要素</h2><p>要让这种推理可计算，冯·诺依曼先把一个博弈剥离成几个精确的数学对象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>记号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与者</td>\n<td>做决策的理性主体</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = 1, 2, \\dots, n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略</td>\n<td>每个参与者可选的完整行动方案</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i \\in S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>每种结果给参与者带来的效用</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i(s_1, \\dots, s_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息</td>\n<td>决策时各方知道什么</td>\n<td>完全/不完全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特别地，他重点研究<strong>两人零和博弈</strong>：一方所得恰为另一方所失，即对任意结果都有</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_1(s_1, s_2) + u_2(s_1, s_2) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>零和意味着双方利益完全对立，没有合作空间，这让问题足够纯粹、可以被彻底求解——这正是 <a href=\"minimax-and-strategy\">最小最大与策略</a> 要展开的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效用-把-偏好-变成可加可比的数\">效用：把&quot;偏好&quot;变成可加可比的数</h2><p>要对&quot;对手会选什么&quot;做数学推理，先得能给各种结果赋一个数值。冯·诺依曼与摩根斯特恩的另一项基础工作，是建立了<strong>期望效用理论</strong>：他们证明，只要一个人的偏好满足若干一致性公理（完备、传递、连续、独立），就一定存在一个效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>，使得他在不确定前景之间的选择等价于最大化期望效用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[u] = \\sum_k p_k \\, u(x_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步意义重大——它把&quot;我更喜欢什么&quot;从模糊的心理感受，变成了可以加总、可以在风险下比较的数。没有这个基础，&quot;支付矩阵&quot;里的数字就无从谈起。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[现实博弈&lt;br/&gt;下棋 谈判 战争] --&gt; B[抽象出参与者]&#10;  A --&gt; C[抽象出策略集]&#10;  A --&gt; D[抽象出支付]&#10;  D --&gt; E[用期望效用&lt;br/&gt;把偏好量化]&#10;  B --&gt; F[形式化的博弈模型]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[求解 稳定结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[现实博弈&lt;br/&gt;下棋 谈判 战争] --&gt; B[抽象出参与者]\n  A --&gt; C[抽象出策略集]\n  A --&gt; D[抽象出支付]\n  D --&gt; E[用期望效用&lt;br/&gt;把偏好量化]\n  B --&gt; F[形式化的博弈模型]\n  C --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[求解 稳定结果]</pre><h2 id=\"一个直观例子-抛硬币猜正反\">一个直观例子：抛硬币猜正反</h2><p>设想一个简单的两人零和博弈：你和对手同时各自亮出&quot;正&quot;或&quot;反&quot;。规则是若两人相同你赢一元，不同则对手赢一元。如果你总是出&quot;正&quot;，对手摸清规律后就总出&quot;反&quot;，你必输。反过来也一样——任何<strong>纯策略</strong>（固定出某一种）都会被对手针对。冯·诺依曼的推理给出的出路是<strong>混合策略</strong>：你以一半概率随机地出正、一半出反。此时无论对手怎么出，你的期望收益都被锁定，对手无从针对。这个看似简单的例子点出了博弈论最反直觉的核心洞见——理性的最优行为常常是&quot;可控的随机&quot;，而非某个确定的招法。</p>\n<p>这种&quot;随机才是最优&quot;的逻辑在现实里随处可见：网球发球该往左还是往右、点球该踢哪个角、查税该抽查哪类申报、扑克该不该诈唬，本质都是零和或近零和的对抗，可被预测就等于被击败。冯·诺依曼的贡献，是把这种谁都隐约感到的&quot;别让对手看穿&quot;，提升为一条有严格数学保证的原则——而保证它存在的，正是下一篇要证明的极小化极大定理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>博弈论的推理把&quot;我的最优选择依赖于你的选择、你的又依赖于我的&quot;这种策略互依，第一次变成可计算的数学问题。</li>\n<li>冯·诺依曼把博弈剥离成参与者、策略、支付、信息四要素，并以两人零和博弈作为最纯粹、可彻底求解的对象。</li>\n<li>期望效用理论把模糊的偏好量化成可加可比的数，为支付矩阵和理性选择奠定基础。</li>\n<li>最优策略常常是&quot;混合策略&quot;这一反直觉结论，由极小化极大定理给出严格保证，见 <a href=\"minimax-and-strategy\">最小最大与策略</a> 及 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-game-theory/the-theory-of-games\">核心贡献·博弈论</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博弈论的推理：把\"对手会怎么想\"变成数学","id":"博弈论的推理-把-对手会怎么想-变成数学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从\"决策\"到\"策略互依\"","id":"从-决策-到-策略互依"},{"level":2,"text":"博弈的形式化要素","id":"博弈的形式化要素"},{"level":2,"text":"效用：把\"偏好\"变成可加可比的数","id":"效用-把-偏好-变成可加可比的数"},{"level":2,"text":"一个直观例子：抛硬币猜正反","id":"一个直观例子-抛硬币猜正反"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计算的架构：五大部件与冯·诺依曼瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/the-stored-program/the-architecture-of-computing"},"next":{"title":"最小最大与策略：在最坏情形下求最优","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/strategic-thinking/minimax-and-strategy"}}